        <mxCell id="1 ·t21" value="WHAT SHIPS

✓  Motion classifier — 99.4% leave-one-driver-out
✓  Alignment engine — 97–100% of theoretical optimum
✓  Kalman fusion, map matching, NHC

✗  Speed regressor — measured, degrades drift, NOT deployed" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2d7d32;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="520" width="700" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1 ·t22" value="BENCHMARKS

5 m over 50 m        1.3 – 2.6 m      PASS on all 4 drivers
100 m over 1 km      102 m            driver E, misses by 1.8 m
                     161 – 196 m      urban drivers

Driver E is the problem statement's stated condition:
steady ~60 km/h, tunnel-like." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f0fe;strokeColor=#4d7fb3;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="520" width="740" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
